; Schema layer of the inference comparison coordinator: nominal identifiers and
; digests, graph and mapping descriptions, recipes, policies, contracts and
; evidence records, each with a strict schema-v1 wire codec. Pure data: it
; depends on [err_trace], [fmt] and [jsont] (the generic JSON value type only),
; so `dune build lib/inference_compare_schema` proves that no engine, compiler,
; Unix or libtorch dependency reaches the schema. See .ai/ (the inference
; comparison coordinator design).
;
; Wrapped (default): consumers see [Inference_compare_schema.Id] and so on.

(library
 (name inference_compare_schema)
 (libraries err_trace fmt jsont jsont.bytesrw))
